---
// Hero.astro - Linear / Vercel Dark Mode Hero
---

<section class="relative pt-16 pb-8 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-10 text-center px-4 overflow-hidden max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <!-- Top Pill -->
  <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-neutral-900/80 border border-neutral-800 text-neutral-300 text-xs font-mono mb-6 shadow-sm">
    <span class="flex h-2 w-2 relative">
      <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
      <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500"></span>
    </span>
    <span>100% In-Browser RAM Sanitization</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Heading -->
  <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-4 leading-[1.15]">
    Strip Hidden <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-red-400 via-rose-500 to-amber-400">EXIF & GPS Leaks</span> Before You Post Online
  </h1>

  <!-- Clean Muted Subtitle with line-height 1.6 -->
  <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-400 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-[1.6] font-normal">
    Smartphone cameras secretly tag your exact home coordinates, device serial numbers, and timestamps. CleanPhoto permanently purges all metadata locally in your browser before uploading to public forums.
  </p>

  <!-- Feature Grid: 2x2 Grid (max-w-xl mx-auto) -->
  <div id="features" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 max-w-xl mx-auto text-left scroll-mt-20">
    <!-- Card 1 -->
    <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-800/80 hover:border-neutral-700 transition-colors rounded-xl p-3 flex items-start gap-3">
      <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800/50 text-neutral-300 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-rose-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25S4.5 17.642 4.5 10.5a7.5 7.5 0 1115 0z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white">GPS Coordinate Scrub</h3>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-neutral-400 leading-normal mt-0.5">Strips latitude, longitude, and elevation tags</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2 -->
    <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-800/80 hover:border-neutral-700 transition-colors rounded-xl p-3 flex items-start gap-3">
      <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800/50 text-neutral-300 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white">Zero Server Footprint</h3>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-neutral-400 leading-normal mt-0.5">100% in-memory HTML5 Canvas rasterization</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3 -->
    <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-800/80 hover:border-neutral-700 transition-colors rounded-xl p-3 flex items-start gap-3">
      <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800/50 text-neutral-300 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.25 3v1.5M4.5 8.25H3m18 0h-1.5M4.5 12H3m18 0h-1.5m-15 3.75H3m18 0h-1.5M8.25 19.5V21M12 3v1.5m0 15V21m3.75-18v1.5m0 15V21m-9-1.5h10.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25V6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H6.75A2.25 2.25 0 004.5 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25zm.75-12h9v9h-9v-9z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white">Hardware Anonymizer</h3>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-neutral-400 leading-normal mt-0.5">Wipes device serial IDs, lens info, and OS builds</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 4 -->
    <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-800/80 hover:border-neutral-700 transition-colors rounded-xl p-3 flex items-start gap-3">
      <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800/50 text-neutral-300 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-sky-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20.25 7.5l-.625 10.632a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.247 2.118H6.622a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.247-2.118L3.75 7.5M10 11.25h4M3.375 7.5h17.25c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125v-1.5c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125H3.375c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v1.5c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white">Batch ZIP Archive</h3>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-neutral-400 leading-normal mt-0.5">1-click bundle export with sanitation report</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
